WEBVTT

00:03.130 --> 00:07.130
We may run a temple, 
but we're throwing a Christmas party.

00:11.100 --> 00:13.610
Let's get this party started!

00:15.490 --> 00:19.490
That said, officially, 
this is just an end-of-year party.

00:19.490 --> 00:21.390
Okay.

01:55.920 --> 02:01.300
<b>Episode 8:
Seeing a Turtle Is Good Luck</b>

01:57.590 --> 02:01.390
<i>Today is a great opportunity for me 
to repay everyone for their kindness.</i>

02:01.640 --> 02:06.180
<i>I'll begin by having them taste my specialties.</i>

02:06.180 --> 02:07.180
<i>And then...</i>

02:07.230 --> 02:13.190
<b><i>BOOM</i></b>

02:07.690 --> 02:12.860
<i>I'll give this present I secretly bought 
to the magnanimous Yuzuki-san.</i>

02:13.190 --> 02:14.850
He said he prepared a feast.

02:14.850 --> 02:17.200
I'm sure it's primarily root vegetables.

02:17.200 --> 02:18.700
Thank you for waiting.

02:21.820 --> 02:23.580
Meat!

02:22.120 --> 02:23.580
<b>Meat</b>

02:23.580 --> 02:25.440
Akagami-kun?!

02:25.440 --> 02:27.130
Where'd you get this meat?!

02:27.130 --> 02:28.830
I have a connection through an old job of mine.

02:29.290 --> 02:31.710
Today's a special day, after all.

02:31.080 --> 02:31.710
GRAB

02:31.710 --> 02:34.140
Marry me, Akagami-san.

02:33.960 --> 02:34.710
<i>PBBBT</i>

02:35.970 --> 02:39.050
I'm honored. Once you're grown up, Kurage-san.

02:39.050 --> 02:42.140
Akagami-kun, don't!

02:40.770 --> 02:43.470
Kurage's serious! Don't agree to it!

02:43.740 --> 02:45.000
Now then, everyone...

02:44.720 --> 02:45.220
<b>CLAP</b>

02:45.000 --> 02:47.220
Let's eat!

02:49.230 --> 02:51.300
Take your time and eat your fill.

02:51.300 --> 02:52.920
There's more over here.

02:52.920 --> 02:54.280
It looks so good!

02:57.270 --> 03:01.400
Now that our bellies are full, 
why don't we exchange presents?

03:01.400 --> 03:02.740
Okay!

03:02.740 --> 03:06.240
<i>The time has come for me to
 convey my gratitude to Yuzuki-san.</i>

03:06.620 --> 03:07.490
TIE

03:07.680 --> 03:09.750
Yuzuki-san, what are you doing?

03:10.150 --> 03:12.240
Getting ready to exchange presents.

03:12.240 --> 03:16.130
We pull these ropes to see 
who we're giving our gifts to.

03:16.130 --> 03:20.770
<i>Oh, no! Our gift exchange is randomized?</i>

03:20.770 --> 03:23.390
<i>This is my first Christmas party.</i>

03:23.390 --> 03:25.970
<i>I was planning to give each 
person their gift separately.</i>

03:25.970 --> 03:27.840
<i>Is there anything I can do about this?</i>

03:27.840 --> 03:29.890
Tie these around your gifts, everyone.

03:28.270 --> 03:29.890
STOP

03:30.140 --> 03:30.640
TIE

03:31.580 --> 03:32.660
Huh?

03:32.660 --> 03:33.340
Huh?

03:34.080 --> 03:37.970
Mia, we don't do the 
"I'm your gift" thing in Japan.

03:37.970 --> 03:39.240
You don't?!

03:39.490 --> 03:39.990
TIE

03:40.720 --> 03:42.240
What are you doing?

03:42.240 --> 03:46.490
ORGAN

03:42.530 --> 03:44.880
I thought I'd give someone 
an organ of their choosing.

03:43.740 --> 03:46.490
Worth about 5 million yen

03:44.880 --> 03:46.490
That's terrifying! Nobody wants that!

03:46.490 --> 03:48.440
Then what should I do?

03:48.440 --> 03:49.770
Same for me!

03:49.770 --> 03:52.860
You didn't bring gifts? Fine, then.

03:53.500 --> 03:55.570
Why don't you use these?

03:53.900 --> 03:58.000
<b>For 1 Day</b>

03:53.900 --> 03:58.000
Will Do Whatever
You Ask: Akagami

03:53.900 --> 03:58.000
Good For 1 Year

03:55.570 --> 03:56.520
I hadn't thought of that!

03:56.520 --> 03:57.600
Oh, yeah!

03:57.000 --> 03:58.000
TWITCH

03:58.260 --> 04:00.260
Does everyone have their ropes?

04:00.260 --> 04:01.260
Yeah!

04:01.530 --> 04:03.910
Ready, and...

04:05.580 --> 04:06.650
I got gloves.

04:06.650 --> 04:08.260
That's my gift.

04:08.260 --> 04:09.370
Thank you.

04:09.370 --> 04:10.770
You're welcome.

04:11.020 --> 04:16.520
<b>Whatever I ask...</b>

04:11.090 --> 04:13.730
But I would've preferred Akagami-san's.

04:13.730 --> 04:16.520
What did you want to make Akagami do?

04:16.520 --> 04:19.280
By the way, which rope 
did you draw, Tsukuyo-san?

04:19.530 --> 04:22.280
For
the
Princess

04:20.270 --> 04:21.420
A kokeshi?

04:21.420 --> 04:22.880
That's my gift.

04:22.880 --> 04:24.280
Th-Thanks.

04:24.530 --> 04:27.030
<b>Sounds like her...</b>

04:24.580 --> 04:26.010
<i>Sounds like her.</i>

04:27.030 --> 04:30.040
High

04:27.030 --> 04:30.040
Low

04:27.030 --> 04:30.040
Off

04:30.040 --> 04:32.040
VRRR

04:32.040 --> 04:34.700
Yuzu-nee, this kokeshi is 
a different kind of kokeshi!

04:34.670 --> 04:35.290
<i><b>KAPOK</b></i>

04:34.700 --> 04:36.340
I'm opening mine.

04:36.340 --> 04:37.790
Yuzu-nee!

04:38.040 --> 04:39.020
A piece of paper?

04:38.420 --> 04:40.050
<b>Marriage
Registration</b>

04:38.420 --> 04:40.050
<b>Wife's Name</b>

04:38.420 --> 04:40.050
Aoba Kurage

04:38.420 --> 04:40.050
<b>Husband's Name</b>

04:40.290 --> 04:42.780
I wish Akagami-san had gotten mine.

04:42.780 --> 04:45.550
Kurage, we're holding a family meeting later.

04:45.550 --> 04:48.770
Looks like I drew my own gift.

04:45.950 --> 04:47.300
For 1 Day

04:45.950 --> 04:47.300
Will Do Whatever
You Ask: Akagami

04:45.950 --> 04:47.300
Good For 1 Year

04:48.770 --> 04:50.020
Me, too.

04:50.020 --> 04:55.060
Oh, so did I. Akagami-san, 
why don't we exchange gifts?

04:53.680 --> 04:55.060
<b>Invitation to Nirvana</b>

04:55.560 --> 04:56.380
What's this?

04:56.380 --> 04:59.300
A DVD of dirty photos of Mia-san.

05:02.530 --> 05:04.570
Kagura!

05:04.570 --> 05:08.130
What have you done?! When did you take those?!

05:04.570 --> 05:08.160
<b>HEH HEH HEH</b>

05:08.510 --> 05:12.080
It must be a joke. I'm sure 
Akagami-kun wouldn't look at them.

05:09.280 --> 05:12.080
<b>HEH HEH HEH</b>

05:12.330 --> 05:14.080
<b><i>GULP</i></b>

05:14.420 --> 05:15.540
Hand it over.

05:16.090 --> 05:16.960
But...

05:16.960 --> 05:18.950
Hand it over.

05:18.950 --> 05:19.960
Understood.

05:20.310 --> 05:23.560
Like Yuzuki-san said, that was a joke.

05:23.560 --> 05:26.170
This my actual gift.

05:26.170 --> 05:26.930
What is it?

05:26.930 --> 05:28.430
<b>Tsukimurakumo
Baths Free Pass</b>

05:26.930 --> 05:28.430
Mixed and Family
Baths Available

05:27.690 --> 05:29.930
Free passes to a hot spring inn.

05:28.800 --> 05:29.930
<b>Tsukimurakumo
Baths Free Pass</b>

05:28.800 --> 05:29.930
Mixed and Family
Baths Available

05:30.860 --> 05:31.960
What?!

05:31.960 --> 05:35.680
They operate 24 hours a day, 365 days a year,

05:35.680 --> 05:39.940
<b>Tsukimurakumo
Baths Free Pass</b>

05:35.680 --> 05:39.940
Mixed and Family
Baths Available

05:35.940 --> 05:38.260
and they're just around the corner.

05:38.260 --> 05:40.300
I had no idea such a miraculous place existed!

05:40.110 --> 05:43.190
<b>Tsukimurakumo
Baths Free Pass</b>

05:40.110 --> 05:43.190
Mixed and Family
Baths Available

05:40.300 --> 05:42.580
I have enough for everyone.

05:43.620 --> 05:45.480
Let's head there after this!

05:45.480 --> 05:47.440
Thank you so much, Kagura!

05:47.440 --> 05:48.530
No problem.

05:48.530 --> 05:52.030
All of you are always doing so much for me.

05:52.370 --> 05:54.540
Don't worry about it.

05:54.890 --> 05:58.040
There's cake for dessert, everyone.

05:58.330 --> 06:01.580
Christmas is awesome!

06:11.020 --> 06:13.740
Thanks for making the offering with me.

06:13.740 --> 06:15.040
It's no problem at all.

06:15.040 --> 06:17.860
I've never had such a fun Christmas.

06:17.860 --> 06:19.310
I'm glad.

06:19.700 --> 06:23.940
I suppose every Christmas 
must've been like this for you.

06:23.940 --> 06:25.860
It hasn't been, actually.

06:25.860 --> 06:26.570
Huh?

06:26.860 --> 06:31.940
Our dad moved out, 
and our mom left for the head temple.

06:31.940 --> 06:36.080
Nobody smiled like they have today.

06:40.270 --> 06:45.410
But they've been smiling since you came here.

06:49.350 --> 06:52.390
It's probably all because of you.

06:53.130 --> 06:54.290
Yuzuki-san...

06:55.370 --> 06:57.890
I'm grateful, you know.

06:58.890 --> 07:02.230
So, um...

07:03.870 --> 07:06.230
<i>This is my golden opportunity!</i>

07:07.540 --> 07:09.610
I got a Christmas present for you!

07:09.610 --> 07:10.350
Huh?

07:11.060 --> 07:12.180
You, too?

07:12.180 --> 07:13.740
You did, too?

07:14.040 --> 07:15.380
Can I open it?

07:15.380 --> 07:16.270
May I?

07:20.610 --> 07:22.970
Is this from Mari-san's shop?

07:22.970 --> 07:24.930
The prayer bead workshop?

07:26.150 --> 07:29.250
Does that mean we both went at different times?

07:29.250 --> 07:30.510
We just missed each other.

07:30.550 --> 07:36.010
<b>The workshop?</b>

07:30.550 --> 07:36.010
<b>Uh-huh</b>

07:30.840 --> 07:34.310
No wonder Mari-san was smiling so much.

07:36.400 --> 07:38.680
We've exchanged our gifts, then. Thank you.

07:38.680 --> 07:40.890
Yes. Thank you.

07:42.580 --> 07:44.980
We exchanged prayer beads...

07:47.020 --> 07:52.620
At Buddhist weddings, the couple 
exchanges prayer beads instead of rings.

08:00.990 --> 08:02.590
Uh...

08:03.220 --> 08:04.470
Um...

08:08.650 --> 08:10.050
There you are.

08:10.050 --> 08:10.880
Kiki-san!

08:10.880 --> 08:13.380
Wh-Where have you been?

08:13.690 --> 08:16.520
The Christmas party is already over.

08:16.520 --> 08:18.890
There's a problem with your 
tokudo ceremony, Yuzuki.

08:18.890 --> 08:20.180
A problem?

08:20.180 --> 08:22.640
Do I lack the necessary skills?

08:22.640 --> 08:25.040
No, the problem is with the location.

08:25.040 --> 08:28.570
The ceremony is held at the temple 
the candidate trains at.

08:28.570 --> 08:31.300
In other words, it'd be in the 
main hall of this temple.

08:31.300 --> 08:32.280
Okay...

08:32.690 --> 08:35.920
Several important members of the 
sect attend the ceremony, as well.

08:35.920 --> 08:40.790
And the temple where the ceremony 
is held is subject to an inspection.

08:42.820 --> 08:47.140
Sometimes the sect meeting itself is called off 
depending on the results of the inspection.

08:47.140 --> 08:48.230
But...

08:50.050 --> 08:52.010
Duct Tape

08:54.050 --> 08:59.050
Mikazuki Temple

08:54.410 --> 08:56.940
We can't afford to repair...

08:56.940 --> 08:59.050
...the temple's principal figure!

08:59.350 --> 09:03.060
<b>The critical moment.</b>

09:03.060 --> 09:06.560
Tsukimurakumo

09:03.060 --> 09:06.560
Baths

09:04.620 --> 09:06.560
This is it.

09:12.130 --> 09:15.070
We'll figure something out.

09:15.470 --> 09:17.570
Let's enjoy ourselves for now.

09:18.000 --> 09:20.330
Don't worry about the cost.

09:20.660 --> 09:22.940
These tickets are all expenses paid.

09:22.940 --> 09:23.760
What?!

09:23.760 --> 09:25.490
We can even stay overnight.

09:25.490 --> 09:26.330
Say what?!

09:26.330 --> 09:29.330
<b>Mixed and Family Baths Available</b>

09:33.340 --> 09:34.650
Welcome.

09:34.650 --> 09:36.280
They're kneeling to greet us?!

09:36.280 --> 09:38.090
It's just your imagination.

09:38.090 --> 09:43.100
<b>SOB SOB</b>

09:38.590 --> 09:43.100
Tsukimurakumo

09:38.590 --> 09:43.100
Manager

09:39.540 --> 09:41.800
Is that the manager? He seems to be cry—

09:41.800 --> 09:43.100
It's just your imagination.

09:43.590 --> 09:49.620
Okay, everyone. Get your towels at the 
front desk so we can enter the hot springs.

09:49.620 --> 09:50.610
Okay!

09:51.730 --> 09:53.580
The entrance is over here.

09:53.580 --> 09:55.920
When's the last time I visited a hot spring?

09:56.360 --> 09:58.360
<b>Akagami-sama's Personal</b>

09:56.360 --> 09:58.360
Three times as good!

09:56.720 --> 09:57.870
What's that?

09:58.360 --> 10:00.120
<b>Akagami-sama's Personal</b>

09:58.360 --> 10:00.120
Three times as good!

10:02.020 --> 10:04.060
So I'm going this way, then?

10:04.060 --> 10:06.580
Ah, a welcoming drink.

10:06.870 --> 10:08.540
Thank you.

10:11.690 --> 10:13.700
How very stimulating...

10:13.700 --> 10:14.470
Huh?

10:18.320 --> 10:20.990
Uh... If you'll excuse me...

10:20.990 --> 10:22.020
Huh?

10:22.510 --> 10:26.520
<b>3-Day
Virility Drink</b>

10:22.940 --> 10:24.010
I'm sorry.

10:26.860 --> 10:28.770
Come on, Yuzu-nee.

10:28.770 --> 10:31.020
Let me see.

10:31.020 --> 10:32.600
What?

10:32.600 --> 10:33.480
Please.

10:33.480 --> 10:35.180
Just once.

10:35.180 --> 10:36.390
Sheesh...

10:37.490 --> 10:39.340
Just once, okay?

10:40.280 --> 10:42.030
<b>CLENCH</b>

10:40.280 --> 10:42.030
<b>BUMP</b>

10:42.030 --> 10:45.320
Even your biceps are cute.

10:45.320 --> 10:48.410
How do these skinny arms 
produce such superhuman strength?

10:48.410 --> 10:50.660
Don't call it superhuman.

10:50.660 --> 10:53.260
Chopping wood builds muscle.

10:53.260 --> 10:55.670
So Yuzuki-san will become
jacked someday, too?!

10:55.960 --> 10:59.050
I should develop a little more muscle, too.

10:59.050 --> 11:00.700
Yes, since your breasts have gotten fatter.

11:00.700 --> 11:02.390
Kurage, don't phrase it like that.

11:02.690 --> 11:05.890
Besides, I wouldn't want them 
to get any bigger...

11:07.390 --> 11:08.270
<b>SMILE</b>

11:08.270 --> 11:09.770
Then give them to me!

11:09.770 --> 11:12.270
Give 'em!

11:10.820 --> 11:13.300
Ow, ow! You'll tear them off!

11:11.400 --> 11:12.270
<b>OW OW OW</b>

11:12.270 --> 11:15.270
Now, now. No roughhousing.

11:22.830 --> 11:26.160
Wow, what an incredible hot spring.

11:26.450 --> 11:30.160
And we've got the whole place 
to ourselves! Score!

11:30.540 --> 11:32.670
This is impressive.

11:35.390 --> 11:36.960
That <i>is</i> impressive.

11:36.960 --> 11:37.970
What is?

11:37.970 --> 11:39.840
You really are beautiful, Mia.

11:39.840 --> 11:40.420
Huh?!

11:40.760 --> 11:43.500
You look like a totally different 
person with your hair down.

11:43.500 --> 11:44.800
Th-Thank you.

11:45.160 --> 11:48.270
You've all got fantastic bodies 
that Akagami would like.

11:49.290 --> 11:50.850
Th-Thanks?

11:51.950 --> 11:55.270
We're all second to her, though.

11:55.980 --> 11:57.520
What a nice hot spring.

11:57.520 --> 12:00.800
How does she have such a nice body 
when she lives so indulgently?

12:00.800 --> 12:02.530
Wow, Master!

12:02.530 --> 12:03.460
Huh?!

12:02.570 --> 12:10.540
<b>SQUISH
SQUISH</b>

12:03.460 --> 12:06.170
You're not too bad yourself, Mia.

12:06.170 --> 12:07.090
Master...

12:07.090 --> 12:10.540
I'm a woman, but even I 
find your body attractive.

12:10.540 --> 12:14.860
Oh, dear. I'm straying from 
the path of enlightenment.

12:10.540 --> 12:22.050
<b>WAAAH</b>

12:10.540 --> 12:22.050
<b>SQUISH SQUISH SQUISH</b>

12:16.460 --> 12:22.050
Okay, quit screwing around and 
get in the bath. You'll catch a cold.

12:27.050 --> 12:30.010
Hey, where's Kagura, anyway?

12:30.010 --> 12:33.240
She's always slow getting 
dressed and undressed.

12:33.240 --> 12:35.190
Speaking of Kagura...

12:35.190 --> 12:38.940
She always has her camera. 
What's she taking pictures of?

12:39.290 --> 12:41.100
<i>Is it dirty pictures?</i>

12:41.720 --> 12:44.640
Don't you ever wonder why she came to a temple?

12:44.640 --> 12:47.450
Well, it's our policy not to ask.

12:48.660 --> 12:52.200
She's always been by my side.

12:52.700 --> 12:54.710
We've known each other since grade school.

12:54.750 --> 12:59.590
Erotic...

12:54.750 --> 12:59.590
Mia-san!

12:55.450 --> 12:58.820
When I was isolated from others...

12:56.330 --> 12:58.210
Mia-san!

12:59.470 --> 13:01.070
I pitched a tent.

12:59.590 --> 13:03.090
<b>I pitched a tent.</b>

12:59.810 --> 13:03.090
When I ran away from home after 
an argument with my parents...

13:03.750 --> 13:07.590
And when I came to Japan, too.
She was always right there with me.

13:07.960 --> 13:11.860
Come to think of it, 
you were pretty quiet at first.

13:11.860 --> 13:14.050
I was nervous at the start.

13:14.050 --> 13:16.540
Now you speak more than her.

13:16.540 --> 13:20.860
Kagura never says much about herself. 
She seems secretive.

13:21.380 --> 13:26.050
She's certainly mysterious. 
There's a lot I don't know about her, too.

13:26.050 --> 13:28.240
But I can say this for certain.

13:29.180 --> 13:31.990
Kagura would never betray me.

13:32.990 --> 13:34.530
After all, we're best friends.

13:39.300 --> 13:42.000
<i>Mia-san, I can hardly believe my luck.</i>

13:42.500 --> 13:45.760
<i>So, what is everyone doing in my personal bath?</i>

13:45.760 --> 13:50.700
<i>I was so surprised that I hid without thinking, 
and now I look like a peeping Tom.</i>

13:50.700 --> 13:51.390
<i>Not only that...</i>

13:51.390 --> 13:54.640
<i>but I have so much vitality, I couldn't 
come out of hiding even if I wanted to!</i>

13:55.010 --> 13:57.700
Kiki-san, am I attractive, too?

13:57.700 --> 13:59.150
Uh, sure.

13:59.550 --> 14:02.150
<i>I must escape without them noticing.</i>

14:05.320 --> 14:06.150
<b>SMILE</b>

14:06.150 --> 14:07.900
<i>She noticed!</i>

14:07.900 --> 14:10.910
<b>STARE</b>

14:09.990 --> 14:10.910
<i>It's over.</i>

14:13.730 --> 14:14.410
<i>Huh?</i>

14:14.410 --> 14:16.380
Sorry I'm late.

14:17.450 --> 14:20.920
<i>Did Kagura-san figure out what's going on?</i>

14:21.370 --> 14:22.920
<i>What an angel.</i>

14:22.920 --> 14:24.190
<i>Now's my chance.</i>

14:24.850 --> 14:30.930
By the way, what would you all do 
if Akagami-san were peeping on us?

14:31.220 --> 14:32.610
I'd peep on—

14:32.610 --> 14:34.040
I'd be mad.

14:34.040 --> 14:34.810
Huh?

14:35.200 --> 14:38.180
You're right. Not only is it a crime,

14:38.180 --> 14:40.460
but it's a sign of questionable character.

14:40.460 --> 14:43.340
A terrible act like that destroys trust.

14:44.070 --> 14:46.570
We'd have to kick him out immediately.

14:46.570 --> 14:48.790
<i>Of course you would!</i>

14:49.900 --> 14:53.070
But we'd have to talk it out first.

14:54.530 --> 14:58.080
Considering what he's like, there
would have to be some reason for it.

14:58.080 --> 15:02.540
That's right. You still don't 
understand Akagami, Kagura.

15:04.040 --> 15:08.050
Though I'd probably be mad 
since it's embarrassing.

15:08.510 --> 15:11.260
<i>Akagami Akemitsu, you fool!</i>

15:11.260 --> 15:16.060
<i>After they've given you so much trust, 
how dare you doubt them for even a moment?!</i>

15:17.310 --> 15:19.280
<i>I should come out and announce my presence.</i>

15:19.280 --> 15:20.810
<i>I'm sure they'll understand.</i>

15:20.810 --> 15:26.190
You all have such special 
feelings for Akagami-san.

15:26.490 --> 15:28.520
Well, not special, exactly...

15:28.520 --> 15:30.420
Yeah. We've been through a lot together.

15:30.420 --> 15:31.570
They sure are special!

15:31.570 --> 15:35.490
That sounds like a wonderful thing. Right?

15:35.940 --> 15:37.050
Hello, everyone!

15:38.010 --> 15:39.200
It's me, Akagami!

15:44.590 --> 15:45.980
Huh?

15:45.980 --> 15:47.570
Eek!

15:47.570 --> 15:50.530
They seeing a turtle at the 
end of the year is good luck.

15:50.530 --> 15:51.430
A turtle?

15:52.050 --> 15:54.050
<b>Reflecting on His Actions</b>

15:54.050 --> 15:57.310
I see. So it was an unfortunate accident.

15:57.310 --> 16:03.310
Reflecting on His Actions

15:57.690 --> 15:58.450
Yes.

15:58.900 --> 16:01.570
But it's also true that 
you were hiding for a while.

16:02.430 --> 16:03.310
Yes.

16:03.600 --> 16:07.020
C'mon, that's enough. 
He did announce his own presence.

16:07.510 --> 16:10.740
I do think that was commendable, but...

16:11.370 --> 16:12.740
Well...

16:12.740 --> 16:22.250
<b>FIDGET FIDGET FIDGET</b>

16:13.050 --> 16:15.660
It really was commendable.

16:15.660 --> 16:18.290
Even more strapping than before.

16:18.290 --> 16:20.980
So very manly.

16:20.980 --> 16:22.250
Th-Thank you.

16:23.170 --> 16:25.400
Well, shall we go?

16:25.400 --> 16:26.760
We're not staying?

16:26.760 --> 16:29.250
We can't leave the temple empty for long.

16:29.630 --> 16:32.080
Do you mind if I stay here?

16:32.080 --> 16:34.510
I didn't get to soak for long enough.

16:34.860 --> 16:37.760
Then I'll stay, too! 
I want to see more of the ryokan!

16:38.130 --> 16:40.060
That's fine.

16:40.060 --> 16:42.770
Well, I should go, too.

16:43.430 --> 16:47.270
Akagami-san, I believe you should take 
another dip in the bath, as well.

16:47.580 --> 16:50.230
Actually, I was thinking about heading back to—

16:50.650 --> 16:53.790
You're leaving looking like that <i>down there</i>?

16:54.610 --> 16:56.290
I'll stay here!

17:00.820 --> 17:02.370
Indoor baths are nice, too.

17:02.930 --> 17:06.220
Anyway, this thing is refusing to go down.

17:06.220 --> 17:08.380
Shall I make it go down?

17:08.740 --> 17:10.310
Yes, please.

17:14.510 --> 17:17.140
Kagura-san?! Wh-Wh-What are you doing here?!

17:17.140 --> 17:18.860
I'll get out right away!

17:18.860 --> 17:19.890
I'm not letting you get away.

17:25.660 --> 17:28.400
Calming it down is a simple task.

17:28.980 --> 17:32.900
I'll lead you to enlightenment.

17:36.650 --> 17:38.330
Just give in.

17:39.710 --> 17:41.790
Destroy all worldly desires!

17:48.810 --> 17:51.450
You really are a persistent person.

17:51.450 --> 17:56.340
I tried so many ways to make you 
give in to your desires, too.

17:56.340 --> 17:57.090
Eh?

17:57.090 --> 18:00.720
I reserved the whole inn, 
planned that prank in the hot spring,

18:01.070 --> 18:04.970
and drugged you with an aphrodisiac 
disguised as a welcoming drink.

18:04.970 --> 18:07.480
<i>So that's why this is happening.</i>

18:07.790 --> 18:11.770
My attempts to seduce you haven't worked,
either. I don't know what to do anymore.

18:11.770 --> 18:12.980
Wait a minute!

18:13.340 --> 18:14.730
Why would you do that?

18:15.700 --> 18:17.650
I'm exterminating a pest.

18:17.650 --> 18:18.530
Huh?

18:19.310 --> 18:23.590
I'm asking you, Akagami-san, 
to leave Mikazuki Temple.

18:24.450 --> 18:28.600
You're in the way of realizing my plan.

18:28.600 --> 18:29.700
What plan?

18:29.700 --> 18:32.030
The reason I came to Japan.

18:32.900 --> 18:36.630
My plan to raise an erotic queen.

18:36.670 --> 18:40.640
<b>Training Plan</b>

18:36.710 --> 18:40.640
<b>Erotic Queen</b>

18:37.430 --> 18:40.640
According to my plan, while living in Japan...

18:40.720 --> 18:48.640
International Exchange
(Intercourse)

18:40.760 --> 18:48.640
Nocturnal (Sexual)

18:41.260 --> 18:46.640
Mia-san would have sexual intercourse 
with at least one hundred men.

18:46.640 --> 18:48.640
Th-That's insane!

18:48.640 --> 18:52.220
Mia-san is the rightful heir 
of the Christoph family.

18:52.220 --> 18:53.060
Kagura-san?

18:53.060 --> 18:56.580
As the great woman leading 
the erotic family, she—

18:56.580 --> 18:58.120
Kagura-san, excuse me...

18:58.120 --> 19:00.410
Excuse <i>me</i>. I'm speaking.

19:00.410 --> 19:03.160
I'm sorry, but I can't keep up.

19:03.730 --> 19:07.160
I thought my plan would go swimmingly.

19:07.160 --> 19:14.060
I never thought you and Mia-san would 
bond over suppressing your desires.

19:14.060 --> 19:18.550
W-Wait a minute. Mia-san doesn't 
like her family's philosophy, so—

19:18.550 --> 19:20.380
That's right.

19:20.380 --> 19:21.940
So why would you do that?

19:21.940 --> 19:23.550
Why do you think?

19:23.980 --> 19:29.210
Why would I assist with such a plan?

19:29.210 --> 19:33.570
Kagura-san, have you been 
betraying Mia-san from the...

19:35.970 --> 19:36.570
...start?

19:36.570 --> 19:41.330
My friend... my very best friend... 
and A-A-Akagami!

19:43.590 --> 19:45.370
Should I get involved?

19:46.580 --> 19:49.080
One, two, three.

19:49.080 --> 19:51.080
Zzz.

19:51.080 --> 19:52.080
Mia-san?!

19:58.100 --> 20:00.170
One, two, three.

20:00.170 --> 20:00.740
Kagu—

20:00.740 --> 20:02.620
Zzz.

20:05.090 --> 20:08.110
The first thing I learned was how to smile.

20:11.190 --> 20:14.730
My family name is Baldwin.

20:16.970 --> 20:20.370
The Baldwin family is linked 
to the Cristoph family.

20:20.370 --> 20:24.870
We work secretly in the shadows 
for the light that is the Christophs.

20:26.340 --> 20:28.230
Do you understand?

20:29.210 --> 20:29.970
No.

20:30.430 --> 20:32.130
I could never betray the Christophs.

20:32.130 --> 20:37.880
Being born a Baldwin means 
being their obedient dog.

20:38.220 --> 20:40.400
Then why don't we do this?

20:40.400 --> 20:41.340
What?

20:41.340 --> 20:43.130
It's not too late to start.

20:43.530 --> 20:47.010
Help Mia-san fight against 
the fetters of her family.

20:49.310 --> 20:51.390
I knew you were an interesting person.

20:51.770 --> 20:56.530
Akagami-san, why do you 
work at Mikazuki Temple?

20:56.530 --> 20:58.900
Because I owe them money.

20:59.220 --> 21:03.400
What will you do after you've repaid your debt?

21:05.310 --> 21:06.090
After...

21:06.980 --> 21:08.730
Will you go on to become a head priest?

21:09.530 --> 21:12.040
Or will you move out of 
the temple and get a job?

21:12.340 --> 21:15.540
Why did you even come to 
Mikazuki Temple in the first place?

21:17.820 --> 21:23.350
To defeat the worldly desires that have 
long made the Akagami family suffer.

21:23.350 --> 21:29.430
So you ran away from home, then?

21:30.100 --> 21:33.760
You and Mia-san are just running away.

21:33.760 --> 21:38.930
While Yuzuki-san is facing her 
family head-on, too. How rude.

21:38.930 --> 21:40.340
I...

21:40.340 --> 21:43.010
Let's make a deal, Akagami-san.

21:43.610 --> 21:44.570
A deal?

21:44.980 --> 21:48.850
I shall take on all your debt.

21:50.210 --> 21:53.320
I'll even pay to have the temple's 
principal figure repaired.

21:53.320 --> 21:55.330
Wh-Why would you do that?

21:56.830 --> 22:03.170
You could save Mikazuki Temple 
very easily if you'd just move out.

22:05.090 --> 22:08.130
Think about it.

23:45.020 --> 23:46.680
Slap, slap.

23:45.020 --> 24:00.040
<b>Next Time

Pounding Mochi Is Dirty</b>

23:46.680 --> 23:48.130
Boing, boing.

23:48.130 --> 23:49.610
Slap, slap.

23:49.610 --> 23:51.040
Boing, boing.

23:51.040 --> 23:52.680
Slap, slap.

23:52.680 --> 23:53.770
Flat, flat?

23:53.770 --> 23:55.180
Flat, flat?

23:56.570 --> 23:58.990
Boing, boing!
